<h2>
HRC Dosage Map
</h2>

<p style='margin-left:30px; margn-right:30px;'>
The tables below show the links to HRC-I and HRC-S dosage history and images.
</p>

<p style='margin-left:30px; margn-right:30px;'>
The plot links show plots of dosage history. The left side shows the
monthly dosage , and the right side shows the cumulative
dosage. The top panels show the average count rate in cnt/pixel,
the middle panels show the maximum count rate and the bottom panels
show the count rate of the pixels at 68%, 95%, and 99.7% percentiles.
The definitions are the same on both monthly and cumulative data.
Since the maximum plot could contain anomalies, a 99.7% plot may
represent the maximum trend more accurately.
</p>

<p style='margin-left:30px; margn-right:30px;'>
The data table displays statistics in a table format and also links to
the dosage images. By clicking the link "map," you can check the
dosage map of that month.
</p>

